"Jonas.", "start": 78.539, "end": 78.919}, {"i": 199, "text": "Take", "start": 79.56, "end": 79.74}, {"i": 200, "text": "care.", "start": 79.78, "end": 80.0}], "segments": [{"start": 0.086, "end": 0.626, "text": "Good morning."}, {"start": 0.907, "end": 1.867, "text": "I am Jonas Bang."}, {"start": 2.267, "end": 3.769, "text": "I hope I have found the right room."}, {"start": 4.309, "end": 4.749, "text": "You have."}, {"start": 5.67, "end": 6.65, "text": "I am Dr. Winther."}, {"start": 7.251, "end": 8.852, "text": "Welcome, and do sit down."}, {"start": 9.552, "end": 9.953, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 10.273, "end": 12.775, "text": "The entrance took me a while to find, I will admit."}, {"start": 13.435, "end": 14.476, "text": "You are not the first."}, {"start": 15.236, "end": 19.039, "text": "The signage out there is optimistic rather than helpful."}, {"start": 19.759, "end": 21.841, "text": "That is a generous way to describe it."}, {"start": 22.401, "end": 24.222, "text": "So, what has brought you in today?"}, {"start": 24.743, "end": 25.703, "text": "Fatigue, mainly."}, {"start": 26.104, "end": 27.405, "text": "That is really the whole of it."}, {"start": 27.805, "end": 29.426, "text": "I have simply been tired."}, {"start": 30.006, "end": 30.446, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 31.247, "end": 32.788, "text": "We have your blood results back."}, {"start": 33.468, "end": 35.069, "text": "Yes, I was keen to hear those."}, {"start": 35.409, "end": 38.03, "text": "What did the haemoglobin A1c show?"}, {"start": 38.571, "end": 44.574, "text": "Your haemoglobin A1c was normal, and the other tests were normal as well."}, {"start": 45.174, "end": 47.796, "text": "All normal, so nothing is showing up in the bloods."}, {"start": 48.396, "end": 48.776, "text": "Correct."}, {"start": 49.637, "end": 53.679, "text": "My assessment is that this is non-pathological fatigue."}, {"start": 54.299, "end": 57.861, "text": "Non-pathological, meaning no disease process behind it."}, {"start": 58.401, "end": 59.342, "text": "That is what it means."}, {"start": 59.722, "end": 59.982, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 60.723, "end": 62.324, "text": "And in terms of the next step?"}, {"start": 62.945, "end": 65.347, "text": "No treatment is needed on that basis."}, {"start": 66.068, "end": 66.548, "text": "Understood."}, {"start": 66.828, "end": 67.489, "text": "That is clear."}, {"start": 67.869, "end": 70.732, "text": "Things have been busy at work, but everyone says the same."}, {"start": 71.292, "end": 74.215, "text": "It does seem to be that season for most people."}, {"start": 74.835, "end": 75.236, "text": "It does."}, {"start": 75.656, "end": 77.398, "text": "Thank you for taking me through the results."}, {"start": 77.958, "end": 78.919, "text": "My pleasure, Jonas."}, {"start": 79.56, "end": 80.0, "text": "Take care."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 1.632}}